<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>

</section>

<section class="content">

<h3>Verse to memorize</h3>

<div class="bible-passage">
<p>«You have made us for yourself, O Lord, and our heart is restless until it rests in you.»</p>
<p class="bible-passage__ref">&mdash; St. Augustine, Confessions I,1 (also CCC 30)</p>
</div>

</section>

<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for this week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord, I thank you because you made me for yourself.<br />
I recognize that sometimes I fill my heart with things that don't satisfy me.<br />
Help me recognize my deepest desire,<br />
and not be afraid to seek your face.<br />
You who are living water, quench my thirst.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

</section>

